        "message": "LU-20429 contrib: support Assisted-by commit tag\n\nThe Assisted-by: tag for AI/LLM attribution (documented at\nhttps://wiki.lustre.org/Commit_Comments#AI/LLM/Tool_Attribution)\nis rejected by checkpatch.pl and the commit-msg hook. Update both\nto accept it.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-4-8\nSigned-off-by: Matt Raso-Barnett <matt@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I1cb12649b1900a05ccdad0d01a7f517ab0ac7c5e\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66894\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\n"
